                </ul>
              </li>
              <li>Skill-building focused on AI/ML, web and mobile development, UX/UI design, and project management</li>
              <li>Evaluations by KPITB officials noted measurable growth from mid-term to final assessments</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CIVIC INNOVATOR -->
        <section id="civic-innovator" class="bg-white rounded-lg border p-6 space-y-6 scroll-mt-28">
